        "ContentType": "Description",
        "SortOrder": 0,
        "Content": "•Coonan Property present this exceptional two-bedroom top-floor apartment, ideally positioned within a gated development in the heart of Maynooth, just a short stroll from the University and train station\n•Well-proportioned accommodation comprises entrance hallway, bright open-plan kitchen/dining/living area, two generous bedrooms and main bathroom\n•Presented in excellent condition throughout, offering a superb turnkey opportunity\n•Recently renovated with upgrades including fitted wardrobes, water pump system and new electric heating system\n•An ideal purchase for first-time buyers, downsizers or investors seeking a quality property in one of Ireland`s most desirable university towns\n•Superbly located just a five-minute walk from Maynooth University, train station, bus stops, shops, cafés, restaurants and a host of local amenities\n•Excellent connectivity with convenient access to the M4 motorway, M50, Dublin City Centre and Dublin Airport\n\n\nGuide Price\n295,000\n\nType of Transaction\nPrivate Treaty\n\nAccommodation:\n\nEntrance Hallway (Including hot press) 3.3m x 1.9m \nLaminate flooring, coving, new electric heaters, hanging pendant light, hot press with shelving and water pump. \n\nLiving/Dining Area 5.1m x 3m\nLaminate flooring, light fitting, coving, feature fireplace and new electric heater. \n \nKitchen 2.8m x 2m \nTiled flooring, light fitting, coving, shaker style floor to wall kitchen cabinets, stainless steel sink, integrated oven, hob, extractor fan, free standing fridge/freezer, dishwasher, fully plumbed with washing machine and tiled splashback surround. \n\nMaster Bedroom 2.7m x 4m\nCarpet flooring, hanging pendant light, coving and new fitted wardrobes. \n\nBedroom 2 2.5m x 3.9m\nCarpet flooring, hanging pendant light and new fitted wardrobe. \n \nFamily Bathroom 1.7m x 1.8m\nTiled flooring, light fitting, extractor fan, coving, w.c, w.h.b. with a tiled splashback, fitted mirror and shaving light, bath with tiled surround and showerscreen. \n\nAdditional Information:\nGross internal floor area approx. 62 sq.m \nBuilt in 1996 \nTop floor apartment \nLift in building \nCommunal parking \nPrivate gated access \nManagement fees approx. 1,500 per annum\nNew water pump system \nNew electric radiators in hallway and living/dining area\nNew fitted wardrobes \n\nItems Included in sale:\nFreestanding fridge/freezer, washing machine, hob, oven, extractor fan, dishwasher and all light fittings. \n\nServices\nMains water \nElectric storage heaters \n\nBER \nD1\n\nViewing\nBy appointment only.\n\nEircode: W23 X799\n\nContact Information\nSales Person \nMick Wright\n01 628 6128\n\n\n \n"
